<urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> <urn:emsenn:corruptionEvent> "2026-07-23T14:59Z live anvil --state file eip155-31337.json was found truncated mid-write (Unterminated string at byte 2412101 of 2418184); anvil could not load it and the chain silently reset to genesis. No pre-corruption snapshot existed in the local off-repo pool (~/.local/state/union/devchain-snapshots/eip155-31337) or its GitHub replica (emsenn/union-devchain-snapshots): both only held post-reset copies. Restore of pre-corruption chain state was therefore impossible; recovery proceeded by redeployment." <urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> .
<urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> <urn:emsenn:displacedStateFile> <ni:///sha-256;5AO3PjCMPzLrL2vGJgiHYiqOvkHxrqHhoAz4fkf26NQ> <urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> .
<urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> <urn:emsenn:priorDeploymentRecord> <ni:///sha-256;EpLz4fQwLwKfVzCG89tvnrU8MJhZCiLboVcgQwt36cY> <urn:uuid:bf5d596a-8672-41d5-95f9-c13aa11798f2> .
